{"term": {"label": "智", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "6A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gaozi-i", "title": "告子上", "description": "告子曰：「性，猶杞柳也；義，猶桮棬也。以人性為仁義，猶以杞柳為桮棬。」\n孟子曰：「子能順杞柳之性而以為桮棬乎？將戕賊杞柳而後以為桮棬也？如將戕賊杞柳而以為桮棬，則亦將戕賊人以為仁義與？率天下之人而禍仁義者，必子之言夫！」\n告子曰：「性猶湍水也，決諸東方則東流，決諸西方則西流。人性之無分於善不善也，猶水之無分於東西也。」", "occurrences": 4, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "信", "id": "信"}, {"form": "受", "id": "受"}, {"form": "同然", "id": "同然"}, {"form": "在", "id": "在"}, {"form": "外", "id": "外"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "志", "id": "志"}, {"form": "智", "id": "智"}, {"form": "火", "id": "火"}, {"form": "炙", "id": "炙"}, {"form": "熟", "id": "熟"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "食", "id": "食"}, {"form": "飲", "id": "飲"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.9266787871274256, "source": "食", "target": "在"}, {"weight": 2.1498223384416355, "source": "食", "target": "外"}, {"weight": 3.5361166995615263, "source": "食", "target": "飲"}, {"weight": 2.6198259676873707, "source": "同然", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 1.9266787871274256, "source": "智", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 1.995671658614377, "source": "智", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.5552874465497997, "source": "智", "target": "外"}, {"weight": 3.9415818076696905, "source": "智", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 1.7443572303334711, "source": "智", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.6888188391743224, "source": "熟", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 3.0252910757955354, "source": "熟", "target": "在"}, {"weight": 2.6888188391743224, "source": "信", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.4375044108934163, "source": "信", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.4566751578816903, "source": "外", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.3025244780544318, "source": "外", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.1498223384416355, "source": "外", "target": "炙"}, {"weight": 2.044461822783809, "source": "外", "target": "在"}, {"weight": 2.5552874465497997, "source": "外", "target": "飲"}, {"weight": 2.5552874465497997, "source": "外"